            "text/markdown": "<span class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents\"><h2 id=\"result\">Result</h2>\n<span class=\"paragraph\"><strong>15.0%</strong> of the frame passes the bright-pass. Under ~1% and the\nbloom is invisible; over ~15% and the map starts to look foggy rather\nthan lit.</span></span>"
          }
        }
