    {
      "id": "SFPL",
      "code_hash": "a5bcdcd237d506a0a30a641824243d8a",
      "outputs": [
        {
          "type": "data",
          "data": {
            "text/markdown": "<span class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents\"><h2 id=\"constants-for-the-shader\">Constants for the shader</h2>\n<span class=\"paragraph\">Paste these into <code>mapRenderer.ts</code> when the look is right:</span>\n<div class=\"language-glsl codehilite\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"c1\">// bright-pass</span>\n<span class=\"k\">const</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kt\">float</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">BLOOM_THRESHOLD</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mf\">0.34</span><span class=\"p\">;</span>\n<span class=\"k\">const</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kt\">float</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">BLOOM_KNEE</span><span class=\"w\">      </span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mf\">0.50</span><span class=\"p\">;</span>\n<span class=\"c1\">// blur</span>\n<span class=\"k\">const</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kt\">float</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">BLOOM_SIGMA</span><span class=\"w\">     </span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mf\">24.0</span><span class=\"p\">;</span><span class=\"w\">   </span><span class=\"c1\">// px, at full res</span>\n<span class=\"k\">const</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kt\">int</span><span class=\"w\">   </span><span class=\"n\">BLOOM_PASSES</span><span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">4</span><span class=\"p\">;</span>\n<span class=\"k\">const</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kt\">int</span><span class=\"w\">   </span><span class=\"n\">BLOOM_DOWNSAMPLE</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">2</span><span class=\"p\">;</span>\n<span class=\"c1\">// composite</span>\n<span class=\"k\">const</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kt\">float</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">BLOOM_INTENSITY</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mf\">1.15</span><span class=\"p\">;</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n<span class=\"paragraph\">Suggested starting point if you want somewhere to return to:\nthreshold 0.34, knee 0.12, \u03c3 7.0, 2 passes, downsample 2, intensity 1.15.</span></span>"
          }
        }
